# Thirty background pages put to sleep: the timed pass no unit test reaches with a real page,
# run here with a one-second threshold (cra://debug?sleepTabs) instead of waiting an hour.
# Each discard ends its renderer; the perf.json check every scenario runs fails if one counts as
# a page crash ("Aw, Snap!"), as all thirty did in 0.1.44.
budget rss=800 stalls50=70   # each new tab stalls ~100 ms today (Nov 2026)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
wait 3
helpers baseline
pace 0.3
repeat 30 cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=${i}
cra://action/nextTab
wait 4
cra://debug?sleepTabs=1
wait 4
expect-log tab sleep (unloads|discards)
helpers settle 2
